#: templates/official_names_review.html:99
msgid ""
"AI Fill for many games at once. The AI fills each game's empty fields, "
"such as genre, release dates and copies sold, the same way the AI Fill "
"button on a game's page does, and saves them straight to the game. Games "
"AI Fill has already done are skipped, so a second run only does the rest."
msgstr ""
"Ukugcwalisa nge-AI kwemidlalo eminingi ngesikhathi esisodwa. I-AI "
"igcwalisa izinkambu ezingenalutho zomdlalo ngamunye, njengohlobo, "
"izinsuku zokukhishwa namakhophi athengisiwe, ngendlela efanayo nenkinobho"
" ethi Ukugcwalisa nge-AI ekhasini lomdlalo, futhi izilondoloze ngqo "
"emdlalweni. Imidlalo esivele yenziwe Ukugcwalisa nge-AI iyeqiwa, ngakho "
"ukusebenza kwesibili kwenza okusele kuphela."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:100
msgid ""
"Your AI provider charges for each game. With Claude Haiku 5.5 and web "
"search on, a game costs at most about 5 US cents."
msgstr ""
"Umhlinzeki wakho we-AI ukhokhisa umdlalo ngamunye. Ngo-Claude Haiku 5.5 "
"nokusesha kuwebhu kuvuliwe, umdlalo ubiza cishe amasenti angu-5 aseMelika"
" ubuningi."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:102
msgid "Fields to fill"
msgstr "Izinkambu ezizogcwaliswa"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:103
msgid ""
"Only the fields switched on are filled, and only games with one of them "
"empty are counted. Fewer fields cost less."
msgstr ""
"Kugcwaliswa kuphela izinkambu ezivuliwe, futhi kubalwa kuphela imidlalo "
"enenye yazo engenalutho. Izinkambu ezimbalwa zibiza kancane."

#: templates/official_names_review.html:105
msgid "All on"
msgstr "Zonke zivuliwe"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:106
msgid "All off"
msgstr "Zonke zivaliwe"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:124
msgid "Include games AI Fill has already done"
msgstr "Faka imidlalo esivele yenziwe Ukugcwalisa nge-AI"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:126
msgid ""
"Turn this on to fill a field in games done before, such as copies sold "
"after turning on web search. Those games are charged again."
msgstr ""
"Vula lokhu ukuze ugcwalise inkambu emidlalweni eyenziwe ngaphambili, "
"njengamakhophi athengisiwe ngemva kokuvula ukusesha kuwebhu. Leyo midlalo"
