msgstr ""
"Phatha amafayela e-binary e-emulator nokuhlelwa kwesistimu ngayinye "
"okusetshenziswa inkinobho ethi ▶ Dlala."

#: templates/settings_emulators.html:20 templates/settings_emulators.html:72
