"RetroDB ships with a default registry seeded on first run. Add custom "
"emulators or edit the seeded entries."
msgstr ""
"I-RetroDB iza nerejista eyisisekelo efakwa lapho iqala ukusebenza. Engeza"
" ama-emulator akho noma uhlele lawo akhona."

