#: templates/_settings_tabs/scraping.html:604
msgid "Let Claude search the web"
msgstr "Vumela u-Claude asese kuwebhu"

#: templates/_settings_tabs/scraping.html:610
msgid ""
"Without search, Claude answers from what it already knows, and leaves "
"blank anything that needs a published figure, such as copies sold. With "
"search on, Claude looks these up, but Anthropic charges for each search: "
"at most 5 searches a game, up to 5 US cents, plus a little for reading "
"the results. Turn it off before a big bulk scrape to keep the cost down."
msgstr ""
"Ngaphandle kokusesha, u-Claude uphendula ngalokho asevele ekwazi, futhi "
"ushiya kungenalutho noma yini edinga inani elishicilelwe, njengamakhophi "
"athengisiwe. Uma ukusesha kuvuliwe, u-Claude uyawasesha lawo manani, "
"kodwa i-Anthropic ikhokhisa ngokusesha ngakunye: ukusesha okungafika ku-5"
" emdlalweni ngamunye, kufika kumasenti angu-5 aseMelika, kanye nemali "
"encane yokufunda imiphumela. Kuvale ngaphambi kwe-scrape enkulu eyisixuku"
" ukuze izindleko zihlale ziphansi."

